# Recipe of the Z9X projector app (1.1 line), read by tools/devices/assemble_app.py: the shared projector menu
# (apps/core/lumen-menu: quick panel D, game menu, their icons, strings, fonts and controller frames) with the Z9X
# profile, then the Z9X app (its screens, its HAL clients and its menu adapters Z9xFeatures / Z9xGameIo).
app       Z9xProjector
module    lumen-menu
file      devices/horse_popular/menu.json assets/lumen_menu/menu.json
top       apps/Z9xProjector
skip      build/ test/ tools/ *.apk CHANGES*.md README*.md SYNCED.txt .DS_Store
